    which component, reference or condition mentioned in the authored requirement
    should you inspect first? Explain your reasoning."
  prediction: "For \u2018Repair R7, V05 and Q1 with fresh retests\u2019, what result
    or observation would you expect if the required setup is correct? Distinguish
    a predicted result from a measured result."
  practice: "In Level 97, perform the objective \u2018Repair R7, V05 and Q1 with
    fresh retests\u2019 in the actual game laboratory. Compare fresh evidence against:
    Recorded from the electrical graph, valid calibrated feedback and the level\u2019s
